### deleted Event by admin
DELETE {{BASE_URL}}/events/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MSwiaWF0IjoxNzc2MDU1MjM3LCJleHAiOjE3NzY2NjAwMzd9.xBVpMORHbaeX-ViIXEOIICGmn8o4jbtKQOiOmxSZhrM